  "text": "\r\n<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN\" >\r\n<HTML>\r\n  <!--%@ OutputCache Duration=60 VaryByParam=\"flora_id;taxon_id\"  %-->\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<!-- Google Tag Manager -->\r\n<script>(function(w,d,s,l,i){w[l]=w[l]||[];w[l].push({'gtm.start':\r\nnew Date().getTime(),event:'gtm.js'});var f=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],\r\nj=d.createElement(s),dl=l!='dataLayer'?'&l='+l:'';j.async=true;j.src=\r\n'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id='+i+dl;f.parentNode.insertBefore(j,f);\r\n})(window,document,'script','dataLayer','GTM-TGK4SMV');</script>\r\n<!-- End Google Tag Manager -->\r\n<title>Zygodon in Bryophyte Flora of North America @ efloras.org</title>\r\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href='/templates/eflora.css' />\r\n<script src=\"JavaScript/eflora.js\" type=\"text/javascript\" ></script>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n\r\n  <!-- body onload=\"formMOMap.submit()\" -->\r\n  <body>\r\n\r\n    <TABLE id=\"TableMain\" cellSpacing=\"1\" cellPadding=\"1\" width=\"640\" border=\"0\">\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD><!--%@ Register TagPrefix=\"ucFlora\" TagName=\"TaxonSearchBox\" Src=\"TaxonSearchBox.ascx\" %-->\r\n\r\n<script language=\"javascript\">\r\n\r\nfunction jsClearTextBox(sender)\r\n{\r\n  // alert(formSearchBox[\"name_str\"].id);\r\n  // alert(sender.value);\r\n  if (sender.value == \"taxon name\")\r\n  {\r\n    sender.value = \"\";\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n</script>\r\n<table id=\"ucEfloraHeader_tableHeaderWrapper\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t<tr>\r\n\t\t<TD style=\"WIDTH: 479px\"><a id=\"ucEfloraHeader_linkFloraHome\" title=\"Flora Homepage\" href=\"flora_page.aspx?flora_id=50\"><img src=\"images/flora/eflora-logo-50.gif\" id=\"ucEfloraHeader_imageLogo\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Link to Bryophyte Flora of North America home\" /><br>\r\n        </a></TD>\r\n\t\t<TD valign=\"bottom\" align=\"right\">\r\n      <div id=\"ucEfloraHeader_panelSearchBox\">\r\n\t\t\t <!-- begin of search box -->\r\n        <FORM name=\"formSearchBox\" action=\"browse.aspx\" method=\"get\">\r\n          <TABLE borderColor=\"#ccffcc\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"2\" width=\"200\" border=\"1\">\r\n            <TR>\r\n              <TD>\r\n                <span id=\"ucEfloraHeader_lblSearchBox\"><INPUT TYPE='Hidden' NAME='flora_id' ' id='flora_id' VALUE='50' >\n&nbsp;<input id=name_str name=name_str &nbsp;  value=''  class=small title='Use % as the wildcard\r\n(e.g. pinus % or pinus a%)'  onfocus='jsClearTextBox(this);' accessKey=s size=15> <input class=small type=submit value=Search name=btnSearch><br>\n <input name=chkAllFloras type=checkbox   > <span class=small>All Floras &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<A HREF='search_page.aspx?flora_id=50'  TARGET='_top'  class='a.link.small'>Advanced Search</A></span>\n</span></TD>\r\n            </TR>\r\n          </TABLE>\r\n        </FORM> <!-- end of search box -->\r\n      \r\n\t\t</div>\r\n    </TD>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n</TD>\r\n      </TR>\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD id=\"tdSubHeader\">\r\n<table id=\"FooterTableOut\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <TD>\r\n      <table bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" id=\"footerTable\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"WIDTH: 291px\">BFNA Vol. 2</td>\r\n          <TD align=\"right\">\r\n            <span id=\"ucEfloraSubHeader_lblLinks\"><a target='_top' href='/login.aspx'>Login</a>\n | <A HREF='/index.aspx'  TARGET='_top' >eFloras Home</A> | <A HREF='/help_page.aspx'  TARGET='_top' >Help</A></span></TD>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </table>\r\n    </TD>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</TD>\r\n      </TR>\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD id=\"tdBody\">\r\n          <table id=\"tableBody\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n            <tr>\r\n              <td id=\"tdLeftBar\" valign=\"top\" width=\"0\"></td>\r\n\r\n              <td id=\"tdContent\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"1930\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td vAlign=\"top\">\r\n                      <table id=\"tableTaxonChain\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t<tr>\r\n\t\t<td><span id=\"lblTaxonChain\"><font size=\"2\"><A HREF='flora_page.aspx?flora_id=50'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='Flora homepage' >BFNA</A> | <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=50'  TARGET='_top' >Family List</A> | <A HREF='volume_page.aspx?volume_id=50002&flora_id=50'  TARGET='_top' >BFNA Vol. 2</A> | <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=10640'  TARGET='_top' >Orthotrichaceae</A> <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=50&start_taxon_id=10640'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='lower taxa' ><img border='0' src='images/layout/icon-list.gif'></A></font></span></td>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n                      <P></P>\r\n                      <div id=\"panelTaxonTreatment\">\r\n\t\r\n                        <span id=\"lblTaxonDesc\"><!-- Default Template -->\r\n<b>Zygodon</b> Hooker & Taylor, Musc. Brit.  70.  1818.  \n<br><small>[yoked (or paired teeth), referring to the 16 peristome teeth that initially are joined in pairs in some of the species]</small>\n \r\n<P>\r\nDale H. Vitt\r\n<P>\r\n\r\n<P>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<b>Plants</b> to 10 cm.  <b>Stem leaves</b> loosely-erect and irregularly twisted or curved around stem, sometimes undulate when dry, erect-spreading to squarrose-recurved when moist, oblong-lanceolate to linear-lanceolate, 0.5--2.0 mm, acute, usually apiculate, keeled, decurrent; margins entire or ± denticulate near apex; costa percurrent, ending near apex, or rarely excurrent; distal laminal cells 4--14 µm wide, densely pluripapillose, smooth or with 3--6 small, clavate papillae per cell, somewhat to very thick-walled; basal laminal cells usually yellowish, subquadrate to rectangular; gemmae elliptic to cylindric or fusiform, 4 to many celled, axillary.  <b>Sexual condition</b> dioicous, autoicous, or synoicous, rarely with sporophytes.  <b>Seta</b> 3--13 mm. <b>Capsule</b> elliptic-oblong to fusiform, 1--2 mm, strongly 8-ribbed along ± the entire length, not constricted beneath mouth; peristome double, single, or lacking; endostome segments 8 or 16, when present; exostome teeth 8 or 16 partially united into 8 pairs.  <b>Spores</b> 11--22 µm.<p>\r\n\r\nSpecies ca. 90 (5 species in the flora): North and South America; Europe; Asia, Africa, Australia, Pacific Islands (New Zealand).<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\nSporophytes are rarely produced in many species of <i>Zygodon</i>, and taxa are delimited on characters derived exclusively from the gametophyte.  Largely pan-tropical with several widespread temperate species.  None of the species is found farther north than 60° N latitude.<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<P>\r\n</span>\r\n                        <P><!-- Key -->\r\n                        <div id=\"panelKey\">\r\n\t\t\r\n                          <BR clear=\"all\">\r\n                          <table id=\"tableKey\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#d5ffff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD width=\"347\">\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKeyTitle\"><b><font size=\"2\"></font></b></span></P>\r\n                              </TD>\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD nowrap=\"nowrap\" align=\"right\">\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKeyEditLink\"><font size=\"1\"></font></span></P>\r\n                              </TD>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#f1ffff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD colspan=\"2\">\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKeyDesc\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span></P>\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKey\"><TABLE  WIDTH='100%' BORDER='0' >\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-1'>1</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Distal leaf cells smooth.</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP> <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=250062041'  TARGET='_top' >Zygodon menziesii</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Distal leaf cells papillose.</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP><A HREF='#KEY-1-2'>(2)</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-2'>2</A> <A HREF='#KEY-1-1'>(1)</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Leaves squarrose-recurved, bluntly acute; distal leaf cells 4--9 µm, very thick-walled; gemmae never present.</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP> <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=250062040'  TARGET='_top' >Zygodon gracilis</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Leaves spreading to ± recurved, sharply acute-apiculate; distal leaf cells 5--14 µm, moderately thick-walled; gemmae always present.</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP><A HREF='#KEY-1-3'>(3)</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-3'>3</A> <A HREF='#KEY-1-2'>(2)</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Abaxial surface of costa covered by quadrate, papillose cells only at extreme apex; synoicous.</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP> <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=200001677'  TARGET='_top' >Zygodon reinwardtii</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Abaxial surface of costa covered by quadrate, papillose cells in distal 1/3 to 1/2 of leaf; dioicous.</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP><A HREF='#KEY-1-4'>(4)</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-4'>4</A> <A HREF='#KEY-1-3'>(3)</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Gemmae fusiform-cylindric, never with transverse walls; distal leaf cells 9--14 µm wide.</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP> <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=200001675'  TARGET='_top' >Zygodon conoideus</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Gemmae clavate to ellipsoidal, with or without transverse walls; distal leaf cells 5--11 µm wide.</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP> <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=250062046'  TARGET='_top' >Zygodon viridissimus</A></td>\n</TR>\n</TABLE>\n</span></P>\r\n                              </TD>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#d5ffff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD colspan=\"2\">\r\n                                <span id=\"lblKeyList\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span></TD>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t</table>\r\n\t\t\r\n                        \r\n\t</div></P> \r\n                        <P>\r\n                          <span id=\"lblLowerTaxonList\"><p>\n<B>Lower Taxa</B><br>\n<ul>\n<li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=200001675' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Zygodon</b> <b>conoideus</b>  (Dickson) Hooker & Taylor</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=250062040' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Zygodon</b> <b>gracilis</b>  Berkeley</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=250062041' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Zygodon</b> <b>menziesii</b>  (Schwaegrichen) Arnott</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=200001677' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Zygodon</b> <b>reinwardtii</b>  (Hornschuch) Bruch, Schimper & W. Gümbel</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=250062046' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Zygodon</b> <b>viridissimus</b>  (Dickson) Bridel</A></ul>\n<p>\n<p>\n<B>Related Synonym(s):</B><br>\n<ul>\n<li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=250062039' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Bryum</i> <i>conoideum</i>  Dickson = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=200001675' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Zygodon</b> <b>conoideus</b>  (Dickson) Hooker & Taylor</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=250062047' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Bryum</i> <i>viridissimum</i>  Dickson = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=250062046' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Zygodon</b> <b>viridissimus</b>  (Dickson) Bridel</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=250062042' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Codonoblepharon</i> <i>menziesii</i>  Schwaegrichen = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=250062041' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Zygodon</b> <b>menziesii</b>  (Schwaegrichen) Arnott</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=250062044' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Syrrhopodon</i> <i>reinwardtii</i>  Hornschuch = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=200001677' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Zygodon</b> <b>reinwardtii</b>  (Hornschuch) Bruch, Schimper & W. Gümbel</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=250062043' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Zygodon</i> <i>drummondii</i>  Taylor = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=250062041' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Zygodon</b> <b>menziesii</b>  (Schwaegrichen) Arnott</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=250062045' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Zygodon</i> <i>reinwardtii</i> var. <i>subintegrifolius</i>  Malta = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=50&taxon_id=200001677' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Zygodon</b> <b>reinwardtii</b>  (Hornschuch) Bruch, Schimper & W. Gümbel</A></A></ul>\n<p>\n</span></P>\r\n                        <BR clear=\"all\">\r\n                        <P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n                        <table id=\"tableObjectList\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" width=\"100%\" border=\"1\">\r\n\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\">\r\n\t\t\t<TD>\r\n                              <TABLE cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n                                <TR>\r\n                                  <TD>\r\n                                    <span id=\"Label1\"><font size=\"2\">\r\n                                      <b>Related Objects</b>\r\n                                    </font></span></TD>\r\n                                  <TD align=\"right\">\r\n                                    <span id=\"lblGalleryLink\"><font size=\"1\"></font></span>&nbsp;</TD>\r\n                                </TR>\r\n                              </TABLE>\r\n                            </TD>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<TD>\r\n                              <span id=\"lblObjectList\"><p>\n<TABLE  WIDTH='100%' BORDER='0' \n\t cellspacing=0>\n<TR >\n  <td class='bold'>Flora of North America</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td width=400><li><A HREF='object_page.aspx?object_id=126021&flora_id=1' \n\tTITLE='Illustration' >Illustration</A></td>\n  <td class='small'>Illustration</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td width=400><li><A HREF='object_page.aspx?object_id=126035&flora_id=1' \n\tTITLE='Illustration' >Illustration</A></td>\n  <td class='small'>Illustration</td>\n</TR>\n</TABLE>\n</span></TD>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</table>\r\n\t\r\n                        <P></P>\r\n                      \r\n</div>\r\n                      <P><div id=\"panelTaxonLinks\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</P>\r\n                      <P>\r\n                        <table id=\"tableLinkList\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" width=\"100%\" border=\"1\">\r\n\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\">\r\n\t\t\t<TD><span id=\"lblLinkTitle\"><font size=\"2\"><b>Related Links</b> (opens in a new window)</font></span></TD>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<TD>\r\n                              <P><span id=\"lblLinkList\"><b>Treatments in Other Floras @ www.efloras.org</b><ul>\n<li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=3&taxon_id=135394'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Chinese Plant Names' >Chinese Plant Names</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=1&taxon_id=135394'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Flora of North America' >Flora of North America</A></ul>\n<p>\n<b>Other Databases</b>\n<ul>\n\n<li><A HREF='http://mobot.mobot.org/cgi-bin/search_pick?name=Zygodon'  TARGET='FLORA_LINK' \n\tTITLE='W3TROPICOS' >W<SUP>3</SUP>TROPICOS</A>\n<li><A HREF='http://www.ipni.org/ipni/IpniServlet?family=&infrafamily=&genus=Zygodon&infragenus=&species=&infraspecies=&author_abbrev=&publication_title=&is_apni_record=on&is_gci_record=on&is_ik_record=on&include_authors=on&include_basionym_authors=on&query_type=by_query'  TARGET='FLORA_LINK' \n\tTITLE='IPNI' >IPNI</A>\n<li><A HREF='http://ravenel.si.edu/botany/ing//INGsearch.cfm?searchWord=Zygodon'  TARGET='FLORA_LINK' \n\tTITLE='ING' >ING Genus Search</A></ul>\n</span></P>\r\n                            </TD>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</table>\r\n\t\r\n                        \r\n</div></P>\r\n                    </td>\r\n                  </tr>\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td>\r\n                      <!-- Links -->\r\n                      <P></P>\r\n                      <P><span id=\"lblEditLinks\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span></P>\r\n                      <P>\r\n                        <!-- Comment List --></P>\r\n                    </td>\r\n                  </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n              </td>\r\n              <TD id=\"tdRightBar\" valign=\"top\"></TD>\r\n\r\n            </tr>\r\n          </table>\r\n        </TD>\r\n      <tr>\r\n        <td>\r\n<table id=\"SubHeaderTableOut\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <TD>\r\n      <table bgcolor=\"#99cc99\" id=\"SubHeaderTable\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <TD align=\"center\" bgColor=\"#ffffcc\">\r\n            &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_linkHome\" href=\"index.aspx\" target=\"_top\">eFlora Home</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_linkPeopleSearch\" href=\"person_search.aspx\" target=\"_top\">People Search</a>\r\n            &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_linkHelp\" href=\"help_page.aspx\" target=\"_top\">Help</a>\r\n            &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_linkActKey\" href=\"http://flora.huh.harvard.edu/china/ActKey\" target=\"_top\">ActKey</a>\r\n            &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_Hyperlink2\" href=\"http://flora.huh.harvard.edu/HuCards/\" target=\"_top\">Hu Cards</a>\r\n            &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_Hyperlink1\" href=\"glossary.aspx\" target=\"_top\">Glossary</a>\r\n            &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n          </TD>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </table>\r\n    </TD>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n</td>\r\n      </tr>\r\n    </TABLE>\r\n  <a href=\"/url.html\" style='display:none'>login</a></body>\r\n</HTML>\r\n"
